        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International GST, Stepped Rose Grab Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Step Up Grab Bar made by RK International is available in 7 sizes including 12 inch, 30 inch and 42 inch. The steeped mounts are classic mainly because they are so versatile, easily blended into both traditional and modern decor. Choose one of the 6 available finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the RK International Modern Step Up Gab Bar:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 6 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n\r\n<b>RKI-GST-1</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 14-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Tubing Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>RKI-GST-2</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 20-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Tubing Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>RKI-GST-3</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 26-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Tubing Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>RKI-GST-4</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 32-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Tubing Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>RKI-GST-5</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 38-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Tubing Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>RKI-GST-6</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 42\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 44-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Tubing Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
